%%body
{
  After gathering up the loose materials in the mining facility, you set your eyes on the coordinates Nori provided.

  It's thankfully not too far from the mines, but the path is still dangerous.

  A moderate walk and you arrive at the complex.

    @ Nori "It's quite surprising how many of these facilities litter the world."

  You had to agree, there were quite a great deal of them.

  Curiously this one was in quite terrible condition.

    @ Nori "Well, this may explain why there was no power, there's barely a facility left."

  A single entity stood in the middle of the ruins, holding a sword of sorts.

    @ Nori "Be careful, that is hostile."

  That?

    @ Nori "It's a guard robot, I was unable to take control of it, so you should be very weary."

  You knew of Nori's work, if he said stay clear: you'd stay clear.

  Staying out of its range, you investigate the old fusion reactor facility, it had very little reactor left and everything had basically fused with the after life.

    @ Nori "Quite devastating, it seems you won't be powering the mines from this one."

  You nod weakly, it meant the other facilities were likely in similar or worst condition too.

    @ Nori "For now I've classified that guard as \"Knight\", I believe it's quite fitting."

  You'd agree.
}
%date 2026-07-31, 2026-08-04, 2026-08-12
